    <!--
      PRODUCT_SPEC SET-002 (Privacy/diagnostics) — the on-device answers to what is actually stored.

      Counts, never names, for anything outside what the active profile may see: the numbers exist to show
      that unauthorized rows were never written, and listing them would defeat the point.
    -->
